 "description": "Klon Centaur Professional Overdrive (1994) as Aion FX's Refractor (document 2.0.1), the KTR's circuit drawn whole, its true or buffered bypass board and footswitch included: an input buffer, then a dual Gain pot that turns up a gain stage clipping into two diodes while it turns down a clean copy of the signal; a summing amp adds the two, then Treble and Output. An LT1054 makes 18 V and -9 V for the summing and treble amps. D1, D2 are BAT41 Schottkys, Aion's choice for the original's germaniums.",
 "tags": [
  "overdrive"
 ],
 "starter": true,
